      perform StartBalancing calibration;
      drive 4000000000 0)
    else ())
  else ()
*)

(* Correctly rejected by the typechecker: a session that moves with zero
   setpoints at Start, to stop the wheels, before it starts the balancing,
   a Move after the calibration:

     Typing error: Variable `calibrated` is unboxed with grade
       `{ReportStatus; ShowTextAt; !500; ReportStatus; !500; ShowTextAt;
       Beep; (ReceiveMessage; ReportStatus; !400)^[1, 500]; Move}`
       accumulated since it was bound, which is not below its box grade
       `{[1000, 600000] & ~Move}`
       ...
*)
